your restaurants kenbaiki and attract different type of customers, do basic ramen bowls really good or dive in to different types, just make sure your up to serve your customers what they ordered.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393720/extras/e4808d06504c60e375fe0b711803abf5.poster.avif?t=1747602234\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393720/extras/e4808d06504c60e375fe0b711803abf5.webm?t=1747602234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393720/extras/e4808d06504c60e375fe0b711803abf5.mp4?t=1747602234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let us cook</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are still working hard on this experience, so please join our discord and follow our social medias! We want to hear what you think and discuss everything from features to gameplay, let\u2019s cook up something great!</p>",
